---
import PathwayChooser from './pathway/PathwayChooser.astro';
import PathwayDiagram from './pathway/PathwayDiagram.astro';
---
<section class="section section--pathway" id="pathway">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">04 · Agent Development Pathway</span>
      <h2>From idea to published agent — pick your path.</h2>
      <p class="pathway-lede">
        AKD is a <b>composable framework</b> for AI agents in NASA science. Each agent is designed with <b>CARE</b>, assembled from shared building blocks — prompts, tools, context, and pluggable guardrail and reasoning services — reviewed by a domain expert, then run on whichever surface scientists already work in: <b>AKD Flow</b>, integrated chatbots in <b>Teams</b> or <b>Slack</b>, <b>Community MCP servers</b>, or <b>hosted chatbots</b> in <b>ChatGPT</b> or <b>ChatGSFC</b>.
      </p>
      <p class="pathway-lede pathway-lede--small">
        The same blocks compose every agent; the same agent reaches scientists wherever they work. Pick a tour below to highlight one path through it. <span class="hover-hint">Hover any card to see its full description; click the <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="11" height="11" style="vertical-align: -1px;"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8a8 8 0 0 0 5.47 7.59c.4.07.55-.17.55-.38v-1.33c-2.23.48-2.7-1.07-2.7-1.07-.36-.92-.89-1.17-.89-1.17-.73-.5.06-.49.06-.49.81.06 1.24.83 1.24.83.72 1.23 1.88.87 2.34.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.13 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82a7.7 7.7 0 0 1 4 0c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.11.16 1.93.08 2.13.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48v2.2c0 .21.15.46.55.38A8 8 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg> mark in any step to open its repository.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container container--wide">
    <PathwayChooser />
    <PathwayDiagram />
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <aside class="pathway-getstarted" aria-labelledby="pathway-getstarted-title">
      <div class="pgs-head">
        <span class="pgs-eyebrow">Ready to build?</span>
        <h3 id="pathway-getstarted-title">Get started on GitHub</h3>
        <p>Clone the main repo, read CARE, and dive into the components that show up along the pathway above.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pgs-cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/AI-Agents-for-Science" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8a8 8 0 0 0 5.47 7.59c.4.07.55-.17.55-.38v-1.33c-2.23.48-2.7-1.07-2.7-1.07-.36-.92-.89-1.17-.89-1.17-.73-.5.06-.49.06-.49.81.06 1.24.83 1.24.83.72 1.23 1.88.87 2.34.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.13 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82a7.7 7.7 0 0 1 4 0c1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.11.16 1.93.08 2.13.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48v2.2c0 .21.15.46.55.38A8 8 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
          Main repository
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20260000926" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📄 CARE Paper (NTRS)</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="pgs-chips" aria-label="Component repositories">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/AKD-CARE" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>CARE</b><span>AKD-CARE</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/akd-core" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>AKD Core</b><span>akd-core</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/akd-ext" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>AKD Ext</b><span>akd-ext</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/akd-labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>AKD Labs</b><span>akd-labs</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/akd/tree/main/flow" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>AKD Flow</b><span>akd · flow</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/NASA-IMPACT/akd/tree/main/guardrails" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>Guardrails</b><span>akd · guardrails</span></a></li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Pathway section uses a wider container so the 8-stage pipeline fits
     without horizontal scroll on standard desktop monitors. */
  .section--pathway .container--wide { max-width: 1400px; }
  .section--pathway .pathway-lede {
    max-width: 920px;
  }
  .section--pathway .pathway-lede--small {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .section--pathway .hover-hint {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .section--pathway .hover-hint::before { content: '↪ '; }

  /* ── Get-started footer block ──────────────────────────── */
  .pathway-getstarted {
    margin-top: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--bg-0);
    padding: 22px 24px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }
  .pgs-head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .pgs-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .pathway-getstarted h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .pathway-getstarted p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .pgs-cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .pgs-chips {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .pgs-chips a {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color .15s ease, transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .pgs-chips a:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .pgs-chips b {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .pgs-chips span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .pgs-chips { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .pgs-chips { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
</style>

<script>
  import './pathway/pathway-interactive.ts';
</script>
